# sitl_compass_error.parm — SITL only: make the FC's heading read ~20 deg
# clockwise of the true nose, as a bad compass does on the real drone.
#   sim_vehicle.py ... -w --add-param-file=<this file>
# The EKF adds COMPASS_DEC to the magnetic heading; EK3_MAG_EF_LIM 0 makes it
# use COMPASS_DEC instead of its own table, COMPASS_AUTODEC 0 stops the FC
# replacing it from GPS. ARMING_MAGTHRESH 0 turns off the arming check that
# catches exactly this (field vs the earth model, "Check mag field (xy
# diff:149>100)"). Never load this on the real flight controller.
COMPASS_AUTODEC 0
COMPASS_DEC 0.35
EK3_MAG_EF_LIM 0
ARMING_MAGTHRESH 0
